{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "daccd0d45948962392e455e9c5267daf8e3f1dcfbe2c9c49984ef14494aa945e",
  "bundle_request_count": 21,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:05b36679b9cf2763ec6da18bbbbf28cdc72d6df7ee3174b06f25486818f1797e",
      "request_id": "05b36679b9cf2763ec6da18bbbbf28cdc72d6df7ee3174b06f25486818f1797e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c59d45a503c3ced13d20e145a275443f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年总决赛的名单，有个地方不对劲。积分第七的穆霍娃，等到十月二十一号，名额才落定；积分第八的诺斯科娃，十月九号就官宣入围了。分少的人先上车，分多的人，在门口多等了十二天。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "19d8c627425a20901afe6ccb1ef6845d74c9c88d651d6189c7687ce2632c2e97",
      "words_sha256": "54d99618c3832d644dd11d20a682ff47a33aee4a5049cceaffa30dedd606f8f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:116cb3e17662410db96cddb7317babe84e7eb010863bb318dc5759471ed3e703",
      "request_id": "116cb3e17662410db96cddb7317babe84e7eb010863bb318dc5759471ed3e703",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "029791c494f7827f2687189413282e33",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "差155分，她先进？第八席不排队先找冠军",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7cfdc5fe22b5e4652346f316c02709aeaa8bed433cae6e9a35d999283473b0fc",
      "words_sha256": "66608fe2f615362a40708293cc6ee3bf3206098104032227175e4b44c214311c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1cd7a2611cf21003370afb4579458bf2745eda50919f8922c4a17bd212cece2c",
      "request_id": "1cd7a2611cf21003370afb4579458bf2745eda50919f8922c4a17bd212cece2c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d262585e62c0271ca95f7a4d7f2eced",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年呢？今年被这条规则改变命运的两个人，全程一言不发。科斯秋克为了追赶第七名，必须连赢两站比赛，结果在宁波第一场就伤退了；斯瓦泰克十月二十号宣布赛季结束，只说身体需要休息。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5f3e6b01c4d2c9c1d76b36f8f6f55e492ca82c1ebb7733f026b80ab4f1079a65",
      "words_sha256": "e041b4d49930bba41084a584e28e084294e5b5cb81fde9d5b3c8f3e734991be6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2cca79795d7e4e5b9e146ad3ca2b3ffbe651e2bb341f4e25b0822540e52c6651",
      "request_id": "2cca79795d7e4e5b9e146ad3ca2b3ffbe651e2bb341f4e25b0822540e52c6651",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d27dfc949f8785d14f46f5d37ea4b4d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而她这个温网冠军，还是从赛点上抢回来的：第三轮对科斯蒂亚，她离出局只剩一分，硬是救回来，一路打到捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a412ae09b0889822d3bf0ce3bc43f52665f51caaaa0d3b2e85b7f710733b8fb9",
      "words_sha256": "b4ac697a7f5b065ce8a266a3b891029955f06955cede3474309613a2f7d68c74"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2efd22ccb97af97fa228c3c4de07ab13284d4f3d11c7332d658909f361ec7729",
      "request_id": "2efd22ccb97af97fa228c3c4de07ab13284d4f3d11c7332d658909f361ec7729",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c809ba1934e4f45e731e8649a900c7f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "更不对劲的是第九名斯瓦泰克：连续五年打进总决赛、拿过冠军的她，和诺斯科娃只差一百五十五分。可就算她把这点分全追回来，也一样进不去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7350fdd465e30ffa76bc3a1a485a62ac72fcec23467a9208f8c2f57af93b7de6",
      "words_sha256": "1fe8caa4cdb6965819af579c52076aeb6e876f79af2c0031d3c7eac5e61a5637"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:362aa3f9a88b13756aef67453ba1fbd90c94dcadc7c48e23f58dee6aafb3aaa9",
      "request_id": "362aa3f9a88b13756aef67453ba1fbd90c94dcadc7c48e23f58dee6aafb3aaa9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5e78fd9f81246936c2c88a1cb8ab665",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "把规则拆开看。前七个名额，按全年积分，也就是 Race 排名，依次直入。第八个名额，是留给冠军的专座：今年四大满贯的冠军里，谁不在前七、又排在第八到第二十名之间，顺位最高的，这个座就是她的；没有这样的人，才轮到第八名。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "da09d8a217db2c51bda08915c16f30c69a9bb10239b8d3ff664ec96b67db2740",
      "words_sha256": "63446448bd820ad5bbc0d1d4e0e1b3ea96439cfdc32eb193ec55154d335c1b11"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:723434fa335b0870617335c58f68bed20aa08c25139c66d484b5c6c10ca6a230",
      "request_id": "723434fa335b0870617335c58f68bed20aa08c25139c66d484b5c6c10ca6a230",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e25d2dc2b0988c0f5eedf0f25b5f9300",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "因为总决赛的第八个名额，根本不排队。它先要问一句：今年的大满贯冠军，是谁？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "decfabf8b8f4de510736120c5736981ee6d68bbc410b39a896680abe71401d37",
      "words_sha256": "3c1406b5bbb8d622dd98324913977536568b58a030caf30aa57e46134aa8fb23"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8316bd9d38cff6d5f54383974d0dd3e92967f18dd769bb7706b576dd9cd1985a",
      "request_id": "8316bd9d38cff6d5f54383974d0dd3e92967f18dd769bb7706b576dd9cd1985a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "328e30ad7876df5ab37f8fe78626c9e0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最戏剧性的是穆霍娃。温网决赛，她输给的正是诺斯科娃：那场球她要是赢了，冠军专座就是她的，十月那十二天的等待，根本不会发生。一场温网决赛，同时决定了两个人的十一月。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "67c9295145d413e6c98f5ffad3bc351f524fa3e58a44ce83b39356463ca4de13",
      "words_sha256": "db516a2c3a5b70957aac15833b19773b53ba9a4ddfdbe91893bad923b327ad2f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8792b6cb5189e3540bcf1f5960615970f1e73e96b89c396beec94d1f103ee5e5",
      "request_id": "8792b6cb5189e3540bcf1f5960615970f1e73e96b89c396beec94d1f103ee5e5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "79ddc079b73f572d348dc624e30141fd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再把规则推到极端。今年四位大满贯冠军里，三位是靠积分直入的，专座只用了一次。要是四位冠军全排在第八到第二十名之间呢？只有顺位最高的一位能进，第二位只能去当第一候补，剩下两位，和所有人一起重新排队。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "afd6832bb902c8fe14620b13cc5c075320e8c6c03e2fe37158dca0923c6ded2f",
      "words_sha256": "75b53edd2571253cdff229f591a511f2af295ce0685c949b26a3254fc0b143c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8871f595358827f8446652913e560e4b00d8800dd301db46c5aca172c62b919a",
      "request_id": "8871f595358827f8446652913e560e4b00d8800dd301db46c5aca172c62b919a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c3db3ee7ad3eeb2e357e9e4639f7cdce",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月九号，WTA 官宣她入围。从那天起，她的名额就和积分脱钩了：哪怕她最后掉到第十三名、第十五名，只要还在前二十，这个座，谁也抢不走。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f525db85a1bb4cf7434659e84c17ecc13ed40e4244fc978a29bf6f32fcb60dd4",
      "words_sha256": "49bf6c21a9ce70b396b4047b86ff91e041ad91722d7b69b03980a577c2b7101a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a44dbab2dbb6be30b050a8ca3fdebf016eb1d76aa0950e5ccf45d4587b034112",
      "request_id": "a44dbab2dbb6be30b050a8ca3fdebf016eb1d76aa0950e5ccf45d4587b034112",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a6877b237648b3767b38883abc294290",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年的冠军，澳网和美网是莱巴金娜，法网是安德列娃，温网是诺斯科娃。前两位早早入围，只剩诺斯科娃站在第八名，专座归她。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "14297599bb03e0b54bed9be6a41920e7be8caa1de56c4db6fa506204c15baa9a",
      "words_sha256": "1818ae4724a4e0f48c7419fe2d7bdb5cde076d6caeac0e4eee1181d174130b10"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2d5d93468049351ad1fdafff28f5930c1907e6f8a0a0581ed650aa83c39e0953",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bdd076596f3068e70503716b9a9ab67bfac4f11dacafddbdaada34e7af4ec4db",
      "request_id": "bdd076596f3068e70503716b9a9ab67bfac4f11dacafddbdaada34e7af4ec4db",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bdadb79a890202c23aae4e9357e946ef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "男子那边，别以为只有女子搞特殊。ATP 总决赛有一条几乎相同的规则：前七直入，第八席同样先给大满贯冠军。只不过今年男子的四座大满贯，被辛纳、阿尔卡拉斯和兹维列夫包揽，全都排在积分前七，专座控着没人用，第八名才安安静静轮到排队的人；后来辛纳赛季报销，这个座又顺延给了第九名。同一条规则，在女网这边改写了一张名单，在男网那边，躺了一整年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cc7a037ae247d968c36aa48982288a9f0b1e8ceef027e1de5431c161cf32cfbd",
      "words_sha256": "2726a6966e8161a13d95597e48e5dbc8f17309286313c0b4886dd67c839c8233"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c95f3e532514d183cd6766010545f7646aa59187d3b3a255b378faaad262e4c9",
      "request_id": "c95f3e532514d183cd6766010545f7646aa59187d3b3a255b378faaad262e4c9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e3f88d554be9f9d323d9825c963d30c0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但不服气的人，到今天也没服。最敢说的是卡萨金娜。她那年是第一候补，临上场替补打了一场，只赢了一局。赛后，她把话说透了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0e77287812260a1ca6c553b99831793855f97c365feb1e6b7af665ba2303d334",
      "words_sha256": "7c3fca9afc86799a133add7937a643923dc22ffb8d5026b057a97e2e851c7995"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d04bc16b75c7719b600b5e5f801d1d662d35fa00daaf59cf92b40c0bde251fc1",
      "request_id": "d04bc16b75c7719b600b5e5f801d1d662d35fa00daaf59cf92b40c0bde251fc1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a73dc3dab8f9fc91aef47e89054adf66",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年，温网冠军克雷吉茨科娃全年只赢了二十一场比赛，Race 排第十二，按老规矩连候补都排不上。新规则把她直接送进总决赛，挤掉的是排第八的纳瓦罗，纳瓦罗干脆拒绝去当候补。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a08638b32539963656996ee08e438dbac44b10d4f51cad1f515010a0301a7543",
      "words_sha256": "e9608ddf4c2c24a82372875d2966dfbb0ebbe8ceae6dabaf42236d22c153c1f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d7ca9f36e0ef5d7cef20aec7f0beb4229d4bca14c3c26e9f36c06613a5f4c2af",
      "request_id": "d7ca9f36e0ef5d7cef20aec7f0beb4229d4bca14c3c26e9f36c06613a5f4c2af",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "06942fdb40a9e4d1357b001833c49ddf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这条规则其实非常年轻，二零二四年才被 WTA 写进规则书。在这之前，总决赛的名单就是积分前八，一个不多，一个不少，几十年没变过。它要解决的问题很现实：总决赛是全年最后一场大戏，如果这一年拿过最大冠军的人，因为积分零零碎碎不够而缺席，这份『全年最佳八人』的名单，自己先心虚。所以 WTA 提前把第八个座，从排队通道里划了出来。规则出生第一年，就改了一张名单。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "dcc2bfd9ab025942196f4955a559ef343b19aa64edcb437f5e03a5d364ff11d0",
      "words_sha256": "7ab55c6d912f1ac87d798d7db185009426a1170eefadd1f0f6a9867f2ddc8288"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ea939c1629bcd8528ad9e0baea1597e51b3a94a0570d6eeda55fc91d8f442ab0",
      "request_id": "ea939c1629bcd8528ad9e0baea1597e51b3a94a0570d6eeda55fc91d8f442ab0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ec635e87d66311a3914f0a277ed10524",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "然后呢？克雷吉茨科娃在小组赛接连赢了佩古拉和高芙，小组第一出线，打进四强。规则的第一年，就交出了这样一份答卷。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "04f8ef36c0e92a1eab19542f4d79f5057b1bc490e7ed363c01a93ffa300b8079",
      "words_sha256": "a019cf174793c7dad0ea6a6dd9458d3a2fa1aab4c437920fb896a389b0aa6b2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f44f144ca25ae62f8287c17ff26d8fd282f476f67d2d6b5f57a123214c2c8600",
      "request_id": "f44f144ca25ae62f8287c17ff26d8fd282f476f67d2d6b5f57a123214c2c8600",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "263550a31f6407e440acc051f973b170",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "科斯秋克伤退后只写了一句：『手腕的疼痛又回来了……明年亚洲见。』吵架的从来不是当事人，是规则之外看球的我们。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1f65cfdccdc730026290f66772ab82618168c94cdfb5c777d8c92e4b2e16d370",
      "words_sha256": "3221f64890b07b002d0fb1a0b768420d04ae8f00caddc0f8d891a570a0291585"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f45fe25f73e295f6bebc9ac74aa6cf1454386408348330b9bdaefea1b5aeefeb",
      "request_id": "f45fe25f73e295f6bebc9ac74aa6cf1454386408348330b9bdaefea1b5aeefeb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e2a6c1474d67af97648f0b30f0ef5f45",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网决赛的两个人想在十一月再打一场，要先各自从小组里杀出来，最早，半决赛见。最后，把规矩交给你们：最后一个名额，一边是整年最稳的人，一边是拿过最大冠军的人。要是由你来定，你给谁？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a1eca352caa2abd7ed284cd1262e548a7866eb5e774b53b9976a6b227947d97d",
      "words_sha256": "bd4ce1bbfd0ad434f14fd140f7eb9962f09adaeaa8e042b6926da1daac4b75a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f58d357c3eeafea1879b430202cf9827e175d2d97ed29e833341654e575410d9",
      "request_id": "f58d357c3eeafea1879b430202cf9827e175d2d97ed29e833341654e575410d9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b25b0c74d5fe898c09dc73af958bb608",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以记住这句话：第八个名额不排队，它先找冠军。今年这八个人，人人手里都有一座大满贯或者一千赛的冠军，成色没的挑。本周日，总决赛就在印第安维尔斯开打。抽签已经揭晓：两个人没能分进同一组——诺斯科娃的第一场，就是整个总决赛的揭幕战，对手是卫冕冠军莱巴金娜；穆霍娃周一首战，要打萨巴伦卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ba5d9d411cba6fa220f5bceb71eedece273068e290adee3f30217bbcecf65f43",
      "words_sha256": "2d6cde2f0a71347b3aa77fd7160f0f85cd114b4d33b8ef342e33c7e1f8e40eb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fe2e1a84976e5ee9bcdd9b54e8fd626bb52ac3eb58892c29e9809c89b8ea6610",
      "request_id": "fe2e1a84976e5ee9bcdd9b54e8fd626bb52ac3eb58892c29e9809c89b8ea6610",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "508ed7387a8bcc10cfbe8ec8d334b237",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她在温网决赛打完最后一分、看着冠军奖杯时，说的是这一句。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4efe9790585028fca8312a0f2a2e3330523650b06063c17b1ef3bb926cdbb994",
      "words_sha256": "33891f01bffb8101a63c8ab67265811e7e8379eef9a59635abaf975033444507"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_00.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "19d8c627425a20901afe6ccb1ef6845d74c9c88d651d6189c7687ce2632c2e97",
      "words_sha256": "54d99618c3832d644dd11d20a682ff47a33aee4a5049cceaffa30dedd606f8f2",
      "words_path": "voice_00.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c59d45a503c3ced13d20e145a275443f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年总决赛的名单，有个地方不对劲。积分第七的穆霍娃，等到十月二十一号，名额才落定；积分第八的诺斯科娃，十月九号就官宣入围了。分少的人先上车，分多的人，在门口多等了十二天。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7350fdd465e30ffa76bc3a1a485a62ac72fcec23467a9208f8c2f57af93b7de6",
      "words_sha256": "1fe8caa4cdb6965819af579c52076aeb6e876f79af2c0031d3c7eac5e61a5637",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c809ba1934e4f45e731e8649a900c7f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "更不对劲的是第九名斯瓦泰克：连续五年打进总决赛、拿过冠军的她，和诺斯科娃只差一百五十五分。可就算她把这点分全追回来，也一样进不去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "decfabf8b8f4de510736120c5736981ee6d68bbc410b39a896680abe71401d37",
      "words_sha256": "3c1406b5bbb8d622dd98324913977536568b58a030caf30aa57e46134aa8fb23",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e25d2dc2b0988c0f5eedf0f25b5f9300",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "因为总决赛的第八个名额，根本不排队。它先要问一句：今年的大满贯冠军，是谁？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "da09d8a217db2c51bda08915c16f30c69a9bb10239b8d3ff664ec96b67db2740",
      "words_sha256": "63446448bd820ad5bbc0d1d4e0e1b3ea96439cfdc32eb193ec55154d335c1b11",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d5e78fd9f81246936c2c88a1cb8ab665",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "把规则拆开看。前七个名额，按全年积分，也就是 Race 排名，依次直入。第八个名额，是留给冠军的专座：今年四大满贯的冠军里，谁不在前七、又排在第八到第二十名之间，顺位最高的，这个座就是她的；没有这样的人，才轮到第八名。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "14297599bb03e0b54bed9be6a41920e7be8caa1de56c4db6fa506204c15baa9a",
      "words_sha256": "1818ae4724a4e0f48c7419fe2d7bdb5cde076d6caeac0e4eee1181d174130b10",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a6877b237648b3767b38883abc294290",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年的冠军，澳网和美网是莱巴金娜，法网是安德列娃，温网是诺斯科娃。前两位早早入围，只剩诺斯科娃站在第八名，专座归她。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a412ae09b0889822d3bf0ce3bc43f52665f51caaaa0d3b2e85b7f710733b8fb9",
      "words_sha256": "b4ac697a7f5b065ce8a266a3b891029955f06955cede3474309613a2f7d68c74",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d27dfc949f8785d14f46f5d37ea4b4d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而她这个温网冠军，还是从赛点上抢回来的：第三轮对科斯蒂亚，她离出局只剩一分，硬是救回来，一路打到捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f525db85a1bb4cf7434659e84c17ecc13ed40e4244fc978a29bf6f32fcb60dd4",
      "words_sha256": "49bf6c21a9ce70b396b4047b86ff91e041ad91722d7b69b03980a577c2b7101a",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c3db3ee7ad3eeb2e357e9e4639f7cdce",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月九号，WTA 官宣她入围。从那天起，她的名额就和积分脱钩了：哪怕她最后掉到第十三名、第十五名，只要还在前二十，这个座，谁也抢不走。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4efe9790585028fca8312a0f2a2e3330523650b06063c17b1ef3bb926cdbb994",
      "words_sha256": "33891f01bffb8101a63c8ab67265811e7e8379eef9a59635abaf975033444507",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "508ed7387a8bcc10cfbe8ec8d334b237",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她在温网决赛打完最后一分、看着冠军奖杯时，说的是这一句。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "dcc2bfd9ab025942196f4955a559ef343b19aa64edcb437f5e03a5d364ff11d0",
      "words_sha256": "7ab55c6d912f1ac87d798d7db185009426a1170eefadd1f0f6a9867f2ddc8288",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "06942fdb40a9e4d1357b001833c49ddf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这条规则其实非常年轻，二零二四年才被 WTA 写进规则书。在这之前，总决赛的名单就是积分前八，一个不多，一个不少，几十年没变过。它要解决的问题很现实：总决赛是全年最后一场大戏，如果这一年拿过最大冠军的人，因为积分零零碎碎不够而缺席，这份『全年最佳八人』的名单，自己先心虚。所以 WTA 提前把第八个座，从排队通道里划了出来。规则出生第一年，就改了一张名单。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a08638b32539963656996ee08e438dbac44b10d4f51cad1f515010a0301a7543",
      "words_sha256": "e9608ddf4c2c24a82372875d2966dfbb0ebbe8ceae6dabaf42236d22c153c1f7",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a73dc3dab8f9fc91aef47e89054adf66",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年，温网冠军克雷吉茨科娃全年只赢了二十一场比赛，Race 排第十二，按老规矩连候补都排不上。新规则把她直接送进总决赛，挤掉的是排第八的纳瓦罗，纳瓦罗干脆拒绝去当候补。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "04f8ef36c0e92a1eab19542f4d79f5057b1bc490e7ed363c01a93ffa300b8079",
      "words_sha256": "a019cf174793c7dad0ea6a6dd9458d3a2fa1aab4c437920fb896a389b0aa6b2a",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ec635e87d66311a3914f0a277ed10524",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "然后呢？克雷吉茨科娃在小组赛接连赢了佩古拉和高芙，小组第一出线，打进四强。规则的第一年，就交出了这样一份答卷。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0e77287812260a1ca6c553b99831793855f97c365feb1e6b7af665ba2303d334",
      "words_sha256": "7c3fca9afc86799a133add7937a643923dc22ffb8d5026b057a97e2e851c7995",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e3f88d554be9f9d323d9825c963d30c0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但不服气的人，到今天也没服。最敢说的是卡萨金娜。她那年是第一候补，临上场替补打了一场，只赢了一局。赛后，她把话说透了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5f3e6b01c4d2c9c1d76b36f8f6f55e492ca82c1ebb7733f026b80ab4f1079a65",
      "words_sha256": "e041b4d49930bba41084a584e28e084294e5b5cb81fde9d5b3c8f3e734991be6",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d262585e62c0271ca95f7a4d7f2eced",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年呢？今年被这条规则改变命运的两个人，全程一言不发。科斯秋克为了追赶第七名，必须连赢两站比赛，结果在宁波第一场就伤退了；斯瓦泰克十月二十号宣布赛季结束，只说身体需要休息。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1f65cfdccdc730026290f66772ab82618168c94cdfb5c777d8c92e4b2e16d370",
      "words_sha256": "3221f64890b07b002d0fb1a0b768420d04ae8f00caddc0f8d891a570a0291585",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "263550a31f6407e440acc051f973b170",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "科斯秋克伤退后只写了一句：『手腕的疼痛又回来了……明年亚洲见。』吵架的从来不是当事人，是规则之外看球的我们。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "afd6832bb902c8fe14620b13cc5c075320e8c6c03e2fe37158dca0923c6ded2f",
      "words_sha256": "75b53edd2571253cdff229f591a511f2af295ce0685c949b26a3254fc0b143c9",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "79ddc079b73f572d348dc624e30141fd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再把规则推到极端。今年四位大满贯冠军里，三位是靠积分直入的，专座只用了一次。要是四位冠军全排在第八到第二十名之间呢？只有顺位最高的一位能进，第二位只能去当第一候补，剩下两位，和所有人一起重新排队。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "67c9295145d413e6c98f5ffad3bc351f524fa3e58a44ce83b39356463ca4de13",
      "words_sha256": "db516a2c3a5b70957aac15833b19773b53ba9a4ddfdbe91893bad923b327ad2f",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "328e30ad7876df5ab37f8fe78626c9e0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最戏剧性的是穆霍娃。温网决赛，她输给的正是诺斯科娃：那场球她要是赢了，冠军专座就是她的，十月那十二天的等待，根本不会发生。一场温网决赛，同时决定了两个人的十一月。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cc7a037ae247d968c36aa48982288a9f0b1e8ceef027e1de5431c161cf32cfbd",
      "words_sha256": "2726a6966e8161a13d95597e48e5dbc8f17309286313c0b4886dd67c839c8233",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bdadb79a890202c23aae4e9357e946ef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "男子那边，别以为只有女子搞特殊。ATP 总决赛有一条几乎相同的规则：前七直入，第八席同样先给大满贯冠军。只不过今年男子的四座大满贯，被辛纳、阿尔卡拉斯和兹维列夫包揽，全都排在积分前七，专座控着没人用，第八名才安安静静轮到排队的人；后来辛纳赛季报销，这个座又顺延给了第九名。同一条规则，在女网这边改写了一张名单，在男网那边，躺了一整年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ba5d9d411cba6fa220f5bceb71eedece273068e290adee3f30217bbcecf65f43",
      "words_sha256": "2d6cde2f0a71347b3aa77fd7160f0f85cd114b4d33b8ef342e33c7e1f8e40eb2",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b25b0c74d5fe898c09dc73af958bb608",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以记住这句话：第八个名额不排队，它先找冠军。今年这八个人，人人手里都有一座大满贯或者一千赛的冠军，成色没的挑。本周日，总决赛就在印第安维尔斯开打。抽签已经揭晓：两个人没能分进同一组——诺斯科娃的第一场，就是整个总决赛的揭幕战，对手是卫冕冠军莱巴金娜；穆霍娃周一首战，要打萨巴伦卡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a1eca352caa2abd7ed284cd1262e548a7866eb5e774b53b9976a6b227947d97d",
      "words_sha256": "bd4ce1bbfd0ad434f14fd140f7eb9962f09adaeaa8e042b6926da1daac4b75a9",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
